  "The Brute armour does not recharge (character shield recharge delay and time 0); its BODY recharges 35% after 8 s, flagged where a fight outlasts it.",
  "AI fire = the \"really accurate\" firing pattern (Legendary accuracy reaches 1 within 3 s); burst duration / separation = the mean of their bounds; co-op modifiers not applied (solo).",
  "Default AI weapons come from the campaign squad templates (Elite minor: plasma rifle; Brute: spike rifle); the character tags only list weapon handling.",
  "Reload times are the first-person reload_empty \"allow interruption\" frame / 30 (Reach reloads are animation-driven).",
  "Plasma Repeater heat curves are not in the XML export; the B3 research values are used (0.03 heat a tick firing, rate 15 + (3-15) x heat^1.5, never overheats). Holding the trigger is modelled; a manual vent (2.5 s) is not.",
  "Bloom / spread ignored (every shot hits), body shots only."
